        {
            "id": "GITHUB-CLAIM-00001",
            "type": "Claim",
            "label": "To be able to escrow NFTs in the case of auctions, Marketplace implements the receiver interfaces for [ERC1155](https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-1155) and [ERC721](https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-721) tokens."
        },
        {
            "id": "GITHUB-CLAIM-00002",
            "type": "Claim",
            "label": "To enable meta-transactions (gasless), Marketplace implements [ERC2771](https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-2771)."
        },
        {
            "id": "GITHUB-CLAIM-00003",
            "type": "Claim",
            "label": "The contract supports both ERC20 currencies and a chain's native token (e.g. ether for Ethereum mainnet). This means that any action that involves transferring currency (e.g. buying a token from a direct listing) can be performed with either an ERC20 token or the chain's native token."
        },
        {
            "id": "GITHUB-CLAIM-00004",
            "type": "Claim",
            "label": "At a high level, we want `Marketplace` to be a single smart contract that supports all features related to both direct listings *and* auction listings."
        },
        {
            "id": "GITHUB-CLAIM-00005",
            "type": "Claim",
            "label": "The `Marketplace` contract supports both ERC20 currencies, and a chain's native token (e.g. ether for Ethereum mainnet). This means that any action that involves transferring currency (e.g. buying a token from a direct listing) can be performed with either an ERC20 token or the chain's native token."
        },
        {
            "id": "GITHUB-CLAIM-00006",
            "type": "Claim",
            "label": "| 2981 | https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-2981 | Multiwrap implements ERC 2981 for distributing royalties for sales of the wrapped NFTs. |"
        },
        {
            "id": "GITHUB-CLAIM-00007",
            "type": "Claim",
            "label": "| 2771 | https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-2771 | Multiwrap implements ERC 2771 to support meta-transactions (aka “gasless” transactions). |"
        },
